     "obj/the-stone": [
      {
       "type": "narrate",
       "style": "chat",
       "text": "\"One eye, middle of the forehead, and he talks like a man — asked us who we were, polite as you like. The stone took twenty-two waggons to set and he rolled it one-handed. We do not fight him, Captain. We think.\""
